WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Hi, I'm Rosie, your guide to Navigate The Pathway.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
You already have experiences that matter.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:22.000
This is a private practice space where you can track courses and experiences, reflect on compassion and your values, learn with your cohort, and shape the story you may use in your medical school application.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Each station explains why the work matters, guides one manageable action, and saves something useful on this device.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
There are no points, rankings, or perfect routes.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
You choose where to begin, and you can change direction whenever you need to.
